{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>Take the meal-offering.</b> After they have offered from it up on high, it is not fitting to eat the remainder except in the holy precinct. And now, begin to eat the statute that HaShem has given you, that you shall always take from the fire-offerings of YHWH. And its meaning: every meal-offering from which they have offered to HaShem."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:09:18.976302802Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}